(footprint "L_Fangcheng_FCH1040" (version 20241229) (generator "checkone") (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Fangcheng FCH1040 molded power inductor, body 11.5 x 10.5 x 4.0 mm max, terminals 2.3 x 3.0 mm at the body ends (FCH1040-680M_datasheet.pdf p.1, 1. dimensions D / E). Land: two pads 4.1 x 4.1 mm, centres +-4.75 mm (+-2.70 ... +-6.80), S. Zimath's v1 land: it covers the whole terminal (+-3.45 ... +-5.75) with a 1.05 mm toe. The maker's land drawing (3. layout, 2.5 x 4.0 at +-3.5, 9.5 mm overall) ends 1.0 mm inside the body ends and leaves the outer part of each terminal without copper (S. Zimath, 2026-11-16: rev 1.1 pads too small). Rev 1.1 2026-11-16")
